            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is by design as buffer in 'mini.starter' doesn't represent an actual file on disk. See #485 for more details.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">This is by design as buffer in 'mini.starter' doesn't represent an actual file on disk. See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1906108661\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/485\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/485/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/485\">#485</a> for more details.</p>",
            "bodyText": "This is by design as buffer in 'mini.starter' doesn't represent an actual file on disk. See #485 for more details.",
